Subject: [PATCH] feat: add one-click Windows local launcher

---
 AVVIA.bat               | 126 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 CHIUDI SERVER.bat       |  20 +++++++
 README.md               |  11 ++++
 apps/web/vite.config.ts |   7 +++
 4 files changed, 164 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 AVVIA.bat
